<title>POLAND: Exbud pays PLN 2.7 mln for subsidary.</title>
<headline>Exbud pays PLN 2.7 mln for subsidary.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Exbud SA bought a 63-percent stake in Polish construction firm Elektromontaz Gdansk SA from the privatisation ministry for 2.7 million zlotys, Exbud said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Exbud had promised it would invest further 3.4 million zlotys in Elektromontaz in the next three years.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
